;    2: TDecorate(count=737, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=16, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=569, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひきょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=いた, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あんのん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とさつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=435, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=なかじまちょうじ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=7236, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6681, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Droga: points to note
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Effect lasts about 10 to 15 minutes
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Releases the brain's brake so the body can use its full muscle power
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・Moving at full strength is therefore extremely dangerous<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I succeeded in refining Droga, but I haven't run any clinical trials on humans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you've ever used Droga, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, could you tell me what effects it has?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that important for finding </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That fungus that looks like a cherry tree―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what if the goshinboku was originally a native variety of the Arata settlement? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You can't exactly say it's unrelated, can you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> already had a rough idea of what both Droga and that cherry-like mushroom really were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I told her what I knew about Droga, it would give her a hint leading to a deeper understanding―that was her thinking.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―I thought back on the abhorrent events of the past.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been summoned by <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE> and threatened.<BR>
Then I was given Droga and weapons, and <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE> left for the memorial service.<PG>
The instructions said to test Droga at half the dose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before the incident, I tested it exactly as told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I certainly felt a considerable effect.<PG>
I told <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> about its effects.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, from what you've described, it's definitely Droga itself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you used Droga to make the Megasawa City case possible."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... it's nothing... Go on, please."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Droga is made from that cherry tree―I've been calling it the Arata cherry―from the roots of the Arata cherry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Once Droga is in the body, it puts you in that 'strength you only find in an emergency' state, and that is how a method like the Megasawa City case became possible."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And Droga has one more interesting feature. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Droga spreads from person to person, like a virus."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Infection...!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Infection through blood contact. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the fresh blood of a Droga user who has just bled comes into contact with the mucous membranes of the face―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the eyes or lips, for example―the spores left in their body change further and pass on to you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I call the people it passes to the second generation, and that second generation is precisely </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"At some point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must have touched the blood of someone from the Arata settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is presumed to have used Droga in the past."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The line connecting Arata and Motoki, and the reason only we didn't die from the toxic gas, began to faintly emerge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So they weren't independent events after all; it seemed they were connected somewhere.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's why I, having nothing to do with Droga, would die the moment I went outside. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All I can do now is hole up here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, the reason you moved into this building..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ひきょう">coward</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, aren't I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I still don't know what the Arata-cherry spores in the air do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I thought it'd be better not to breathe in the spores of a fungus like that, if I could help it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But if I announced something like that, there'd surely be a panic. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I meant to announce it once I had firmer research results. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I think that Arata cherry is probably giving off some kind of toxic gas."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you mean you can never leave here!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. And the solar panels are probably covered by these blossoms too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Once the building's storage batteries run out, then..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Isn't there anything you can do!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, do you get it!? At this rate you're going to die too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But there's nothing I can do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't have a gas mask, and if even breathing through the skin is bad, whatever I do―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then this is no time to be looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, is it!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Let's find a way to get you out of here first!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There's only one way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What!? I'll help with anything!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"For me to touch </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> blood and become second generation, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then the sooner the better."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, please wait on that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">As I said earlier, why the Arata cherry lives the way it does is a mystery. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, becoming a Droga carrier can't actually be called safe either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The only benefit of being a Droga carrier that we know of so far is resistance to the toxic gas. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Conversely, one could also hypothesize that normal air has become toxic gas for the infected."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No way...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That was an exaggerated example. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If normal air were poison, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you two</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> couldn't even be in this room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't scare me like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Listen, the side effects of Droga are completely unknown. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll be fine. I'm the only one in this building who survived, so if I save power, the storage batteries will last a month."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's not the point..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Within a month, a rescue team is sure to come. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Until then, I plan to push my research further here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then I'll stay here too! I need to help you out even a little, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You can't do that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why not!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why did you bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wasn't it to set </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> free? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You understand what waiting here for a rescue team would mean, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">yeah."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Even if I die, I at least want to figure out what on earth this phenomenon is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I love Motoki, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I can find even a small clue to putting this place back the way it was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島あいさつ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm a researcher, more or less! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Even at a time like this, I just have to know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">So I want to leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in your hands, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then before we leave here, I'll at least go scrounge up some preserved food around here and bring it back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島考える32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, that feels a bit like shoplifting, so I'm a little uneasy about it, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">in an emergency like this, it can't be helped. That'd be a big help."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Okay, I'll go right now. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what about you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll come too. More hands will help, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Thanks."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"If you'd like, both of you, please stay here tonight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What you two told me gave me some things I want to look into, so I may be able to give you some good information before you leave."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―A three-minute walk from <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan's</STYLE> building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To scout out things that would help <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE> hole up, <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> and I snuck into the supermarket.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I say snuck in, but there was no one around to keep watch on us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\クリスタルコア.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "懐中電灯" "グラフィック\背景\特殊\懐中電灯.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\スーパー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We walked through the dark supermarket lighting our way with flashlights, gathering up canned goods and fruit one after another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then gas canisters for the portable gas stove, matches, toilet paper, things like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While we were at it, we stuffed anything that looked useful into the baskets, not just food.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Even after an earthquake like that, the displays haven't collapsed at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you wouldn't know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">These days it's a given to use earthquake-proof shelves as a precaution. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　My place was tidy too, wasn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In inconspicuous places like this, civilization had apparently made further progress.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
In this supermarket too, several bodies lay on the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Food taken from a place like this isn't something I much want to eat, but I can't be choosy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハエ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "900" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\魚.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The fresh food section was terrible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The seafood especially: with the refrigeration no longer working, it gave off a stench of rot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with the temperature low, could things <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="いた">spoil</STYLE> this much in a single day...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Flies were swarming over the fish, shrimp, and squid laid out bare.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
