<STYLE ID="1">"Poison isn't all one thing. There's something called selective toxicity. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's something lethal to particular organisms but harmless to others―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">insecticides and herbicides, for example. </STYLE>
