{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But that creates a contradiction."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Assuming </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> have antibodies, why was Droga able to become one? </STYLE>
