<STYLE ID="12">Around 11 a.m. today, the government announced that it will dispatch a special unit tomorrow morning to conduct an on-site survey. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">We now bring you the press conference by Chief Cabinet Secretary </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">"Tomorrow, we will dispatch a special unit of about 10 to Sawa Prefecture to conduct an on-site survey. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">They will arrive on-site in the morning and confirm survivors and the extent of the damage."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">―Excuse me, Chief Cabinet Secretary, why is the unit as small as 10?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"There are reports of a toxic gas of unknown origin in the area, so equipment capable of protecting the human body is required. We will dispatch as many personnel as we can equip."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">―A question from here as well. Is the toxic gas of unknown origin the result of terrorism after all?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"There is a possibility of terrorist activity taking advantage of the earthquake. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">We are investigating it both as terrorism and as a natural disaster."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">―There is information that giant plants have spread out over the area. Is this true?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"The government is also aware of such reports, but at present they are unconfirmed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">We are collecting high-resolution satellite images and will release them as soon as we know more."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Doesn't look like there's much new information. And it seems what's coming tomorrow isn't a rescue team either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right. It seems people on the outside can't grasp any more than this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'd like to take a little break. It's exactly noon, so let's have lunch."</STYLE><BR>
